# PowerShell scripts must be saved as UTF-8 *with* BOM: Windows PowerShell
# 5.1 reads a BOM-less file in the system ANSI code page (Big5 on zh-TW), so
# the Chinese strings break parsing and GPO startup scripts fail. Git keeps
# the BOM bytes as they are; CI rejects scripts without one.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.psd1 text eol=crlf
